 "notes": "Payphone (t0431.0, 428-450 / 832-858 s). Flow seen: coin into the blue slot (costs 1) -> display \"PICK UP\" -> lift the handset off the cradle -> \"PHONE\" -> digits as typed (\"555-5678\"; < deletes) -> \"CALLING\" above the number -> dialogue. Hang up by dropping the handset back on hookPos or pressing the lever. The handset is draggable (grab anywhere in hit); while it is off the hook hide cu_payphone_cord and draw the cord yourself as a sagging grey #a5a5a5 44 px wide curve from cordAnchor to the handset cordAttach (rotate/translate that point with the handset). Keys: flash a dark overlay (rgba(0,0,0,0.18)) on the key rect for ~0.12 s. Lever: rotate ~ +20 deg about its pivot while pressed. Display text is drawn by the game (slots.display).",
